<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Douglas cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Douglas cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Douglas Holding AG, a German cosmetics store chain, was cut to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the brokerage said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The stock was down 35 pfennigs at 56.70 marks.</p>
<p>Goldman cut its estimates for earnings per share at the company to 2.8 marks for 1996 and to 3.1 marks in 1997 from 2.9 marks and 3.2 marks respectively.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
